    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXVIIII} Gif ciepemon uppe on folce ceapie, do þæt beforan gewitnessum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a merchant does trade out in the countryside, let him do it in the presence of witnesses.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a trader [makes his way into] the interior of the country and [proceeds to] traffic, he shall do so before witnesses.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ceapmon uppe on folce ceapgie, dó þæt beforan gewitnesse.</ab>
      </div>
